# SHA256 manifest for EigenLabs/Qwen3.8-27B-MTP-4bit.
# Revision: 329261c5e0b3f9c233485e682cb3b67b88c20a55
#
# The MTP HEAD for track bonsai2-27b-mlx-v1. It is a SEPARATE artifact from
# the target: the target pack declares mtp_num_hidden_layers: 0 and ships no
# mtp.* tensors, so the head cannot come from the target manifest.
#
# The head is published and is used UNMODIFIED. Nothing here re-quantizes it,
# mirrors it or re-uploads it.
#
# The loader reads three of these four files. model.safetensors holds the head;
# model.safetensors.index.json names the shard each tensor lives in; config.json
# declares model_type qwen3_5_mtp, block_size, the affine 4-bit group-64
# quantization and the text_config whose geometry is checked against the loaded
# target. README.md is pinned because the tree is small and a flat inventory
# check reads in both directions.
#
# .gitattributes is DELIBERATELY NOT pinned: it is generated by Hugging Face and
# is not engine-loaded.
#
# model.safetensors carries the LFS object's own sha256 (lfs.oid).
#
#   MLXFAST_REFERENCE_MANIFEST_RECORDS: 4
#   MLXFAST_REFERENCE_MANIFEST_BYTES:   238942843
#
# Format: <sha256> <byte_count> <relative_path>
